{"2947300": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "The Down Below", "steam_appid": 2947300, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>THE DOWN BELOW</strong> is a short adventure horror fps inspired by titles such as <strong>Dusk, The Pony Factory, Half Life, System Shock 2, </strong>and other similar titles. The Down Below focuses on mystery and story-telling with some bloody combat. You'll face various different horrors as you explore the underground labyrinth of dark and mysterious experiments.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2947300/extras/aa09fbfdc2ae51ea2bfa1b6da3ddafdc.poster.avif?t=1787386312\" aria-label=\"Explore a twisted labyrinth with horrors around every corner.\" width=852 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2947300/extras/aa09fbfdc2ae51ea2bfa1b6da3ddafdc.webm?t=1787386312\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2947300/extras/aa09fbfdc2ae51ea2bfa1b6da3ddafdc.mp4?t=1787386312\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><strong>The Down Below</strong> features 4 distinctly interesting levels to explore, each with their own thick atmosphere. Fight your way through over 9 uniquely horrific enemies. Experience an immersive and interactive game world with detailed environments. There are over 30 items you can interact with such as ammo, food, and explosives you can find to continue exploring deeper, as well as plenty of physics based props that can be picked up and interacted with in fun ways. There are 4 different endings. Can you find them all?<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2947300/extras/917db1de731e11d13fe3b447826a1095.poster.avif?t=1787386312\" aria-label=\"See detailed levels full of danger and mystery.\" width=596 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2947300/extras/917db1de731e11d13fe3b447826a1095.webm?t=1787386312\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2947300/extras/917db1de731e11d13fe3b447826a1095.mp4?t=1787386312\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>With your wits and your trusty lever action shotgun, uncover the mystery of the missing mercenaries and the grotesque experiments of a research team gone rogue.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2947300/extras/eed88886bc59881183cd20cad938b267.poster.avif?t=1787386312\" aria-label=\"Stay on your toes, you don&#039;t know what could leap from the shadows...\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2947300/extras/eed88886bc59881183cd20cad938b267.webm?t=1787386312\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2947300/extras/eed88886bc59881183cd20cad938b267.mp4?t=1787386312\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>THE DOWN BELOW</strong> is a short adventure horror fps inspired by titles such as <strong>Dusk, The Pony Factory, Half Life, System Shock 2, </strong>and other similar titles. The Down Below focuses on mystery and story-telling with some bloody combat. You'll face various different horrors as you explore the underground labyrinth of dark and mysterious experiments.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2947300/extras/aa09fbfdc2ae51ea2bfa1b6da3ddafdc.poster.avif?t=1787386312\" aria-label=\"Explore a twisted labyrinth with horrors around every corner.\" width=852 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2947300/extras/aa09fbfdc2ae51ea2bfa1b6da3ddafdc.webm?t=1787386312\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2947300/extras/aa09fbfdc2ae51ea2bfa1b6da3ddafdc.mp4?t=1787386312\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><strong>The Down Below</strong> features 4 distinctly interesting levels to explore, each with their own thick atmosphere. Fight your way through over 9 uniquely horrific enemies. Experience an immersive and interactive game world with detailed environments. There are over 30 items you can interact with such as ammo, food, and explosives you can find to continue exploring deeper, as well as plenty of physics based props that can be picked up and interacted with in fun ways. There are 4 different endings. Can you find them all?<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2947300/extras/917db1de731e11d13fe3b447826a1095.poster.avif?t=1787386312\" aria-label=\"See detailed levels full of danger and mystery.\" width=596 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2947300/extras/917db1de731e11d13fe3b447826a1095.webm?t=1787386312\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2947300/extras/917db1de731e11d13fe3b447826a1095.mp4?t=1787386312\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>With your wits and your trusty lever action shotgun, uncover the mystery of the missing mercenaries and the grotesque experiments of a research team gone rogue.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://share